## Awards

Award definitions and the year each award was introduced.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| award_id | Award ID | string | Stable award identifier; join using this value. | award_id |
| award_name | Award Name | string | Recorded award name. | award_name |
| award_description | Award Description | string | Description of the award and its selection criteria. | award_description |
| year_introduced | Year Introduced | integer | Year the award was first introduced. | year_introduced |

